<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="Query Rewriting">
  <data key="d0">Query Rewriting</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The process that transforms and optimizes user queries in a modern system to improve performance, scalability, and reliability.&lt;SEP&gt;A key concept in modern systems, responsible for preprocessing data, batch processing, and maintaining state consistency. It ensures system availability through mechanisms like retrying, traffic smoothing under high load, and graceful degradation during service failures.&lt;SEP&gt;A core concept discussed in the document, covering principles, architecture, and engineering practices of query rewriting in modern systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-979d472a84804b9f647bc185a877a8b5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9dcb88e0137649590b755372b040afad-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-093f65e080a295f8076b1c5722a46aa2-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">213&lt;SEP&gt;188&lt;SEP&gt;59</data>
  <data key="d5">1788256849</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Stage 4">
  <data key="d0">Stage 4</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Stage 4 refers to a specific phase in a broader process or workflow, often situated within development, testing, or implementation contexts. This phase is primarily characterized by its focus on integration and regression testing, aiming to ensure the system's reliability, functionality, and performance under various conditions. Central to Stage 4 is the incorporation of regression pipelines, including the importation of data, embedded models, and generated documents, all of which support the verification of system capabilities and the refinement of processes.

One of the defining aspects of Stage 4 is its emphasis on regression analysis within the data pipelines. The phase involves tasks such as importing inverted indexes, implementing chain regression, and subjecting the system to rigorous evaluations. This includes the use of tools like query rewriting and processes such as "重排序" (re-ranking) and 熔断降级 (circuit-breaking degradation), which are integrated to enhance system optimization and downstream performance. Additionally, benchmarks are evaluated within this stage as part of regression testing, contributing to the larger goal of system validation.

In performance testing contexts, Stage 4 focuses on batch imports and evaluates the system’s ability to handle simulated load conditions effectively. This phase also includes generating and verifying documentation to support the overall regression process. By integrating these varied components, Stage 4 plays a critical role in refining, verifying, and optimizing the regression chain to ensure the alignment and reliability of all system components within the broader workflow.&lt;SEP&gt;A stage in the performance testing pipeline where batch import performance is thoroughly evaluated.&lt;SEP&gt;A batch import performance testing stage where the Document Sharding Strategy is applied.&lt;SEP&gt;A batch import performance testing phase mentioned in the document for which the test document is generated.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific phase in the testing process, where batch import performance tests are conducted using the generated documents.&lt;SEP&gt;A batch import phase mentioned in the test document where the document is used for performance testing.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-979d472a84804b9f647bc185a877a8b5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb163727917cbba1eea208541a643e74-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1534b76d325a8f591b52d302e7181331-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-091d584fced301b442654dd8c23b3fc9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eae27d77ca20db309e056e3d2dcd7d69-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e2c0be24560d78c5e599c2a9c9d0bbd2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3644a684f98ea8fe223c713b77189a77-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-854d6fae5ee42911677c739ee1734486-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-84d9ee44e457ddef7f2c4f25dc8fa865-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0e65972dce68dad4d52d063967f0a705-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-084b6fbb10729ed4da8c3d3f5a3ae7c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0aa1883c6411f7873cb83dacb17b0afc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cfecdb276f634854f3ef915e2e980c31-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02522a2b2726fb0a03bb19f2d8d9524d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1afa34a7f984eeabdbb0a7d494132ee5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-76dc611d6ebaafc66cc0879c71b5db5c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ec5decca5ed3d6b8079e2e7e7bacc9f2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26657d5ff9020d2abefe558796b99584-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-812b4ba287f5ee0bc9d43bbf5bbe87fb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2838023a778dfaecdc212708f721b788-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">213&lt;SEP&gt;211&lt;SEP&gt;212&lt;SEP&gt;208&lt;SEP&gt;205&lt;SEP&gt;203&lt;SEP&gt;200&lt;SEP&gt;202&lt;SEP&gt;199&lt;SEP&gt;198&lt;SEP&gt;196&lt;SEP&gt;191&lt;SEP&gt;190&lt;SEP&gt;134&lt;SEP&gt;131&lt;SEP&gt;128&lt;SEP&gt;127&lt;SEP&gt;96&lt;SEP&gt;95&lt;SEP&gt;51</data>
