<node id="Throughput">
  <data key="d0">Throughput</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Throughput is a fundamental performance metric used to evaluate the rate at which work, tasks, data, or operations are processed within a specific period of time. It serves as a critical measure of a system’s capacity, operational efficiency, and resource utilization, quantifying the volume of data processed or the number of operations, transactions, or requests successfully completed over a defined timeframe. Widely applicable across various domains—including distributed systems, knowledge graph systems, query rewriting systems, vector databases, semantic caching, monitoring systems, data masking, text compression, document sharding workflows, and distributed index systems—throughput provides essential insights into system performance and processing capacity.

In large-scale data processing or distributed environments, throughput is a vital benchmark for assessing overall system performance, detecting bottlenecks, and monitoring resource efficiency. It is consistently identified as a core monitoring metric across these systems, often measuring the rate of successful data processing or the number of transactions handled per unit time. For example, in monitoring systems, it helps ensure optimal resource allocation and consistent operational delivery; in knowledge graphs and vector databases, it enables operators to analyze processing capacity and identify areas needing improved efficiency; and in semantic caching, it measures the amount of data processed over time. In document sharding workflows and distributed index systems, throughput is tracked as one of the primary metrics—often listed among the three core monitoring metrics—to gauge the volume of processed data.

The consistent measurement of throughput supports better decision-making regarding workload management and system optimization, making it a central metric for tracking and improving data handling capabilities in both small-scale and enterprise-level operations. Its role as a core monitoring indicator is emphasized across all contexts, underscoring its importance in evaluating processing capability and system health.&lt;SEP&gt;A core monitoring metric that measures the rate of successful data processing in the system.&lt;SEP&gt;One of the three core metrics monitored in query rewriting systems, measuring processing capacity.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-979d472a84804b9f647bc185a877a8b5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb163727917cbba1eea208541a643e74-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f3ef77ac0e3619e98159e9b6febf557-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b1d10e7bafa4421218a51b1e1f1b0ba2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eabe3a1649ffa2b3ff8c02ebfd5659f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-274ad4786c3abca69fa097b85867d9a4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-84d9ee44e457ddef7f2c4f25dc8fa865-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0e65972dce68dad4d52d063967f0a705-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-85d8ce590ad8981ca2c8286f79f59954-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0336dcbab05b9d5ad24f4333c7658a0e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bd686fd640be98efaae0091fa301e613-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-58a2fc6ed39fd083f55d4182bf88826d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cfecdb276f634854f3ef915e2e980c31-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a2557a7b2e94197ff767970b67041697-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9dcb88e0137649590b755372b040afad-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-31fefc0e570cb3860f2a6d4b38c6490d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eecca5b6365d9607ee5a9d336962c534-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-65ded5353c5ee48d0b7d48c591b8f430-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1afa34a7f984eeabdbb0a7d494132ee5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ec5decca5ed3d6b8079e2e7e7bacc9f2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-069059b7ef840f0c74a814ec9237b6ec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26657d5ff9020d2abefe558796b99584-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-812b4ba287f5ee0bc9d43bbf5bbe87fb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3ef815416f775098fe977004015c6193-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fe9fc289c3ff0af142b6d3bead98a923-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28dd2c7955ce926456240b2ff0100bde-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbd7939d674997cdb4692d34de8633c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ea5d2f1c4608232e07d3aa3d998e5135-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f39f8317fbdb1988ef4c628eba02591-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-072b030ba126b2f4b2374f342be9ed44-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-093f65e080a295f8076b1c5722a46aa2-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">213&lt;SEP&gt;211&lt;SEP&gt;210&lt;SEP&gt;209&lt;SEP&gt;206&lt;SEP&gt;204&lt;SEP&gt;199&lt;SEP&gt;198&lt;SEP&gt;197&lt;SEP&gt;195&lt;SEP&gt;193&lt;SEP&gt;192&lt;SEP&gt;190&lt;SEP&gt;189&lt;SEP&gt;188&lt;SEP&gt;187&lt;SEP&gt;185&lt;SEP&gt;132&lt;SEP&gt;131&lt;SEP&gt;127&lt;SEP&gt;126&lt;SEP&gt;96&lt;SEP&gt;95&lt;SEP&gt;85&lt;SEP&gt;83&lt;SEP&gt;77&lt;SEP&gt;76&lt;SEP&gt;64&lt;SEP&gt;61&lt;SEP&gt;60&lt;SEP&gt;59</data>
