<node id="Latency Percentiles">
  <data key="d0">Latency Percentiles</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Latency Percentiles are a set of performance metrics that quantify the distribution of system response times across various percentile thresholds. They provide a detailed view of how latency is distributed, offering insights into the percentage of requests completed within specific time frames. These measurements are crucial for monitoring and evaluating system performance, particularly in distributed systems, query rewriting, text compression systems, and Consistent Hashing frameworks.

By capturing latency statistics at different percentile levels, Latency Percentiles enable system administrators and developers to identify performance bottlenecks and understand delay patterns under various operating conditions. This performance indicator helps assess how efficiently a system handles requests and evaluates the response time distribution to ensure an optimized user experience. Ultimately, Latency Percentiles serve as a critical tool for maintaining and improving the overall reliability and responsiveness of complex systems.&lt;SEP&gt;A set of statistical measurements in semantic caching that captures the time it takes for operations to complete, expressed as percentiles.&lt;SEP&gt;A performance measure indicating the distribution of response times, crucial for analyzing delays in vector database operations.&lt;SEP&gt;监控中需要关注的核心指标之一，用于衡量延迟分布。&lt;SEP&gt;Core metrics used to measure delay distribution and assess system responsiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;A core monitoring metric that captures the distribution of request response times at various percentile levels.&lt;SEP&gt;One of the three core monitoring metrics, measuring the distribution of response times.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-979d472a84804b9f647bc185a877a8b5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb163727917cbba1eea208541a643e74-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f3ef77ac0e3619e98159e9b6febf557-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eabe3a1649ffa2b3ff8c02ebfd5659f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-84d9ee44e457ddef7f2c4f25dc8fa865-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0336dcbab05b9d5ad24f4333c7658a0e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bd686fd640be98efaae0091fa301e613-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cfecdb276f634854f3ef915e2e980c31-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-31fefc0e570cb3860f2a6d4b38c6490d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eecca5b6365d9607ee5a9d336962c534-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28dd2c7955ce926456240b2ff0100bde-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ea5d2f1c4608232e07d3aa3d998e5135-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-072b030ba126b2f4b2374f342be9ed44-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-093f65e080a295f8076b1c5722a46aa2-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">213&lt;SEP&gt;211&lt;SEP&gt;210&lt;SEP&gt;206&lt;SEP&gt;199&lt;SEP&gt;195&lt;SEP&gt;193&lt;SEP&gt;190&lt;SEP&gt;187&lt;SEP&gt;185&lt;SEP&gt;77&lt;SEP&gt;64&lt;SEP&gt;60&lt;SEP&gt;59</data>
  <data key="d5">1788256850</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Error Rate">
  <data key="d0">Error Rate</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Error Rate is a fundamental performance metric used to quantify the proportion of errors or failures encountered by a system relative to its total operations over a specified period. It is expressed as the percentage of failed or erroneous operations in relation to the total workload, making it particularly valuable in high-volume or complex system environments. This metric serves as a crucial indicator for assessing the reliability, stability, and efficiency of various systems, including distributed systems, text compression systems, knowledge graph systems, vector database systems, document sharding systems, and distributed index systems, as well as implementations of strategies such as Document Slicing or Consistent Hashing.

As a core monitoring tool, Error Rate enables system administrators and engineers to evaluate the frequency, severity, and patterns of system failures, facilitating an understanding of overall system health and performance. By tracking the rate at which errors occur, the metric supports the identification of performance bottlenecks, inefficiencies, and points of degradation within the system. This data is pivotal for implementing timely interventions aimed at improving operational stability, reducing failure rates, and enhancing the system's long-term robustness and reliability. In specific contexts, it is recognized as one of the three core monitoring metrics requiring attention in distributed index systems, and it plays a key role in semantic caching by measuring error frequency within that system. Overall, Error Rate is a versatile and essential performance indicator across diverse technological domains, providing a quantitative basis for system optimization and operational excellence.&lt;SEP&gt;A core monitoring metric that measures the proportion of failed operations or requests in the system.&lt;SEP&gt;One of the three core monitoring metrics, measuring the proportion of failed requests.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-979d472a84804b9f647bc185a877a8b5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb163727917cbba1eea208541a643e74-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f3ef77ac0e3619e98159e9b6febf557-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b1d10e7bafa4421218a51b1e1f1b0ba2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eabe3a1649ffa2b3ff8c02ebfd5659f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-274ad4786c3abca69fa097b85867d9a4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-84d9ee44e457ddef7f2c4f25dc8fa865-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0e65972dce68dad4d52d063967f0a705-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-85d8ce590ad8981ca2c8286f79f59954-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0336dcbab05b9d5ad24f4333c7658a0e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bd686fd640be98efaae0091fa301e613-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-58a2fc6ed39fd083f55d4182bf88826d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cfecdb276f634854f3ef915e2e980c31-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a2557a7b2e94197ff767970b67041697-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9dcb88e0137649590b755372b040afad-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-31fefc0e570cb3860f2a6d4b38c6490d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eecca5b6365d9607ee5a9d336962c534-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-65ded5353c5ee48d0b7d48c591b8f430-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1afa34a7f984eeabdbb0a7d494132ee5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ec5decca5ed3d6b8079e2e7e7bacc9f2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-069059b7ef840f0c74a814ec9237b6ec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-26657d5ff9020d2abefe558796b99584-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-812b4ba287f5ee0bc9d43bbf5bbe87fb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3ef815416f775098fe977004015c6193-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fe9fc289c3ff0af142b6d3bead98a923-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28dd2c7955ce926456240b2ff0100bde-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbd7939d674997cdb4692d34de8633c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ea5d2f1c4608232e07d3aa3d998e5135-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f39f8317fbdb1988ef4c628eba02591-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-072b030ba126b2f4b2374f342be9ed44-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-093f65e080a295f8076b1c5722a46aa2-chunk-000</data>
