</node>
<node id="State Consistency">
  <data key="d0">State Consistency</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">State Consistency is a foundational property in computing systems that ensures the maintenance of coherent, synchronized, and reliable data states throughout various operational workflows. It guarantees that system states remain uniform and aligned even under high computational loads or during complex processing operations, such as batch processing tasks that handle large volumes of data. This principle is critical in distributed systems, where data processing occurs across multiple nodes or environments, as well as in specialized applications like text compression systems, semantic caching systems, document sharding systems, and frameworks utilizing Consistent Hashing.

In the context of batch processing, State Consistency ensures that data remains coherent, accurate, and aligned across all operations, safeguarding data integrity and system reliability. It upholds the synchronization and uniformity of information during both querying and rewriting processes, preventing inconsistencies that could arise from fluctuating loads or concurrent tasks. By maintaining a stable and consistent state throughout the execution of workflows, this property provides robust benchmarks for system evaluation and is essential for ensuring overall system accuracy, coherence, and trustworthiness.&lt;SEP&gt;A key principle maintained during batch processing in distributed index systems to ensure data reliability.&lt;SEP&gt;A state that the system maintains consistency of while processing data in batches.&lt;SEP&gt;The maintenance of consistent system state during batch processing operations.&lt;SEP&gt;The property of maintaining consistent system state across distributed components during batch operations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-979d472a84804b9f647bc185a877a8b5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb163727917cbba1eea208541a643e74-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f3ef77ac0e3619e98159e9b6febf557-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b1d10e7bafa4421218a51b1e1f1b0ba2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eabe3a1649ffa2b3ff8c02ebfd5659f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-84d9ee44e457ddef7f2c4f25dc8fa865-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0336dcbab05b9d5ad24f4333c7658a0e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cfecdb276f634854f3ef915e2e980c31-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-31fefc0e570cb3860f2a6d4b38c6490d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ec5decca5ed3d6b8079e2e7e7bacc9f2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-069059b7ef840f0c74a814ec9237b6ec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-812b4ba287f5ee0bc9d43bbf5bbe87fb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7647966b7343c29048673252e490f736-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3ef815416f775098fe977004015c6193-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fe9fc289c3ff0af142b6d3bead98a923-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbd7939d674997cdb4692d34de8633c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3295c76acbf4caaed33c36b1b5fc2cb1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f39f8317fbdb1988ef4c628eba02591-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-072b030ba126b2f4b2374f342be9ed44-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">213&lt;SEP&gt;211&lt;SEP&gt;210&lt;SEP&gt;209&lt;SEP&gt;206&lt;SEP&gt;199&lt;SEP&gt;195&lt;SEP&gt;190&lt;SEP&gt;187&lt;SEP&gt;127&lt;SEP&gt;126&lt;SEP&gt;95&lt;SEP&gt;89&lt;SEP&gt;85&lt;SEP&gt;83&lt;SEP&gt;76&lt;SEP&gt;66&lt;SEP&gt;61&lt;SEP&gt;60</data>
  <data key="d5">1788256843</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Preprocessing">
  <data key="d0">Preprocessing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Preprocessing is the initial stage in various data handling and processing workflows, where raw data is prepared, formatted, and transformed to ensure optimal performance and efficiency in subsequent operations. It serves as a foundational step across numerous systems and methodologies, including query rewriting, document slicing, data masking, text compression, distributed indexing, semantic caching, document sharding, vector database systems, and evaluation benchmarks. By standardizing and preparing input data, preprocessing facilitates smoother integration into the core processing pipeline or main workflow.

As part of preprocessing, raw or unstructured data undergoes necessary adjustments—such as formatting, cleaning, or transformation—to align with the requirements of the main system. This stage ensures that information is better suited for handling during primary operations, enhancing processing accuracy and efficiency. In semantic caching operations, preprocessing specifically involves transforming raw data into a usable format. Similarly, it is a critical step where data is prepared before entering the main document sharding workflow, the primary processing flow in vector database systems, or the main indexing workflow in distributed index systems.

Preprocessing is also the initial data processing step before entering the main compression flow, whether for text compression or other data reduction applications. Regardless of the specific application, preprocessing plays a critical role in enabling downstream tasks to function effectively by addressing potential inconsistencies or inefficiencies in the input data before it enters core computational processes, ultimately ensuring that downstream operations are executed with greater accuracy and efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;The initial data processing step that occurs before data enters the main flow of query rewriting.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-979d472a84804b9f647bc185a877a8b5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b1d10e7bafa4421218a51b1e1f1b0ba2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-274ad4786c3abca69fa097b85867d9a4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-84d9ee44e457ddef7f2c4f25dc8fa865-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0e65972dce68dad4d52d063967f0a705-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0336dcbab05b9d5ad24f4333c7658a0e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cfecdb276f634854f3ef915e2e980c31-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a2557a7b2e94197ff767970b67041697-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-31fefc0e570cb3860f2a6d4b38c6490d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ec5decca5ed3d6b8079e2e7e7bacc9f2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7647966b7343c29048673252e490f736-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3ef815416f775098fe977004015c6193-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbd7939d674997cdb4692d34de8633c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f39f8317fbdb1988ef4c628eba02591-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-072b030ba126b2f4b2374f342be9ed44-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-093f65e080a295f8076b1c5722a46aa2-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">213&lt;SEP&gt;209&lt;SEP&gt;204&lt;SEP&gt;199&lt;SEP&gt;198&lt;SEP&gt;195&lt;SEP&gt;190&lt;SEP&gt;189&lt;SEP&gt;187&lt;SEP&gt;127&lt;SEP&gt;89&lt;SEP&gt;85&lt;SEP&gt;76&lt;SEP&gt;61&lt;SEP&gt;60&lt;SEP&gt;59</data>
