<node id="Load Smoothing">
  <data key="d0">Load Smoothing</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An operational practice to control and balance system load using approaches such as queuing and concurrency control.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-eb163727917cbba1eea208541a643e74-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">211</data>
  <data key="d5">1788255924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Retry and Degraded Mode">
  <data key="d0">Retry and Degraded Mode</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A mechanism to ensure system availability by retrying failed operations and falling back to reduced functionality when dependent services are experiencing issues.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-eb163727917cbba1eea208541a643e74-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">211</data>
  <data key="d5">1788255924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="重排序">
  <data key="d0">重排序</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The core concept discussed in the document, which plays a key role in modern systems by maintaining data integrity, optimizing processing through concurrency controls, retry mechanisms, and system degradation strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;A core concept in modern systems that involves mechanisms for reordering data to ensure consistency, manage load, and tolerate service dependencies.&lt;SEP&gt;核心技术概念，在系统中执行数据批次处理、状态一致性维护、并发控制与流量缓冲，以及通过重试与降级保障可用性。&lt;SEP&gt;A modern system technique whose core concepts, architecture, and engineering practices are detailed in the document; it handles data through preprocessing and batch processing while maintaining state consistency.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;A technical mechanism in modern systems that processes data through a main flow after preprocessing, maintaining state consistency and handling performance through concurrency control and queue buffering.&lt;SEP&gt;A system component discussed in the test document that processes data through preprocessing, batch handling, and state consistency maintenance.&lt;SEP&gt;核心概念，涉及数据处理的主流程与状态一致性维护，是现代系统中的关键角色。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1534b76d325a8f591b52d302e7181331-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6cdd60ea0045eb7a6ec44c54d29ed402-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5f93f983524def3dca464469d2cf9f3e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98dce83da57b0395e163467c9dae521b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7cbbc409ec990f19c78c75bd1e06f215-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2838023a778dfaecdc212708f721b788-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-642e92efb79421734881b53e1e1b18b6-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">212&lt;SEP&gt;184&lt;SEP&gt;110&lt;SEP&gt;93&lt;SEP&gt;70&lt;SEP&gt;51&lt;SEP&gt;48</data>
  <data key="d5">1788256953</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="吞吐量">
  <data key="d0">吞吐量</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">吞吐量 (Throughput) is a critical performance metric used to evaluate the efficiency and capacity of a system by measuring the volume of data, requests, or operations processed within a specified period of time. It serves as a key indicator for assessing system performance, particularly regarding data handling, transfer rates, and request processing. By quantifying the rate at which a system handles input data, queries, or operations, throughput provides insights into the system’s ability to manage varying workloads and optimize operational efficiency. It is consistently recognized as one of the three core metrics to monitor across diverse systems, including evaluation benchmarks, semantic caching systems, knowledge graph systems, embedding model monitoring, and federated learning systems.

This metric is extensively applied in various contexts, including streaming computation, multichannel recall systems, vector databases, and general system monitoring, where it reflects the amount of data or requests the system can process per unit time. In streaming computation and vector databases, throughput is a core performance indicator tracking the volume of data processed per unit time, helping organizations gauge system capabilities and ensure performance levels meet user or business requirements. Additionally, throughput is a fundamental monitoring metric for the 分词算法 (tokenization algorithm), measuring the number of operations processed per unit time, and is one of the three core monitoring indicators in the 评估基准 (evaluation benchmark) system.

Specifically, throughput serves as a core metric in message queue (消息队列) monitoring for the number of messages processed per unit time, is used in masking systems to measure data volume processed per unit time, and is a core monitored metric in query rewriting to measure the rate of successful processing. It is also a key indicator that needs to be monitored in the context of 熔断降级 (circuit breaking and degradation) systems. Throughput is tracked during performance evaluation to gauge system processing capacity, making it a vital component of system monitoring and optimization strategies. By focusing on the measurable rate of data processing over time, throughput plays a crucial role in tracking, analyzing, and improving the functionality of systems designed to operate under diverse conditions and loads, enabling organizations to assess system capacity, identify bottlenecks, and make informed decisions to enhance operational efficiency and responsiveness.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1534b76d325a8f591b52d302e7181331-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-091d584fced301b442654dd8c23b3fc9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-69adc1e107f7f7d035d7baf04342e1ca-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eae27d77ca20db309e056e3d2dcd7d69-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e2c0be24560d78c5e599c2a9c9d0bbd2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3644a684f98ea8fe223c713b77189a77-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-757b505cfd34c64c85ca5b5690ee5293-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-854d6fae5ee42911677c739ee1734486-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-084b6fbb10729ed4da8c3d3f5a3ae7c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a597e50502f5ff68e3e25b9114205d4a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0aa1883c6411f7873cb83dacb17b0afc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9872ed9fc22fc182d371c3e9ed316094-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6cdd60ea0045eb7a6ec44c54d29ed402-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02522a2b2726fb0a03bb19f2d8d9524d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9fc3d7152ba9336a670e36d0ed79bc43-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f1de29e6da19d22b51c68001e7e0e54-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-76dc611d6ebaafc66cc0879c71b5db5c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3def184ad8f4755ff269862ea77393dd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8ffe9a587b126f152ed3d89a146b445-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-202cb962ac59075b964b07152d234b70-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c56ff4ce4aaf9573aa5dff913df997a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da4fb5c6e93e74d3df8527599fa62642-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ef059938ba799aaa845e1c2e8a762bd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb160de1de89d9058fcb0b968dbbbd68-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b44928ae11fb9384c4cf38708677c48-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5fd0b37cd7dbbb00f97ba6ce92bf5add-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-73278a4a86960eeb576a8fd4c9ec6997-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f6ffaa6bb0b408017b62254211691b5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-698d51a19d8a121ce581499d7b701668-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5f93f983524def3dca464469d2cf9f3e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2723d092b63885e0d7c260cc007e8b9d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3c65c2974270fd093ee8a9bf8ae7d0b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a97da629b098b75c294dffdc3e463904-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-65b9eea6e1cc6bb9f0cd2a47751a186f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9e1074f5b3f9fc8ea15d152add07294-chunk-00