<node id="数据">
  <data key="d0">数据</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Preprocessed system inputs required for consistent batch processing via "重排序."&lt;SEP&gt;Structured information that undergoes preprocessing before entering the main workflow of the system.&lt;SEP&gt;数据refers to the input processed during the benchmarking process, which undergoes preprocessing before entering the main workflow.&lt;SEP&gt;Data that undergoes preprocessing before entering the main processing flow within the described message queue system.&lt;SEP&gt;The information processed by the system through preprocessing and the main algorithm flow.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1534b76d325a8f591b52d302e7181331-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-091d584fced301b442654dd8c23b3fc9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f1de29e6da19d22b51c68001e7e0e54-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9778d5d219c5080b9a6a17bef029331c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9f61408e3afb633e50cdf1b20de6f466-chunk-000</data>
