<node id="Remote Service Latency">
  <data key="d0">Remote Service Latency</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The round-trip delay encountered when communicating with external services or systems.&lt;SEP&gt;A common problem involving high network round-trip delays when accessing remote services.</data>
