<node id="主流程">
  <data key="d0">主流程</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">主流程 is the primary workflow and core processing pipeline within a system, serving as the central backbone that coordinates processing stages across a wide range of applications. It functions as the main execution path through which preprocessed data is channeled, whether in a “重排序” (re-ranking) process, an embedding model, a benchmarking (评估基准) process, a consistent hashing system, a data masking system, a federated learning system, an inverted index (倒排索引) system, a multi-recall system, a word segmentation algorithm, query rewriting, a semantic caching system, a knowledge graph system, or a text compression system. In all contexts, 主流程 receives data that has already undergone preprocessing and drives it through the system’s core logic, operating uniformly regardless of the underlying application type.

The design of 主流程 emphasizes batch processing as a key operational mechanism, enabling efficient throughput and controlled resource usage. A critical requirement of this workflow is the maintenance of system state consistency, ensuring that the processing pipeline remains reliable and accurate across multiple batch executions. This function is consistent across all cited contexts, whether in streaming computation, benchmarking, federated learning, data masking, or text compression, where 主流程 handles batched data after preprocessing and preserves the integrity of the overall system state.

In the semantic caching system, the main processing flow is the specific stage that preprocessed data enters for subsequent processing. Similarly, in the data masking system, 主流程 is the main processing flow that handles data after preprocessing. In the tokenization algorithm, it is the core processing stage that handles the prepared data, while in the evaluation benchmark system, it is the main processing flow that receives preprocessed data. In the重排序system, it is the core processing pipeline that handles batch data processing and maintains state consistency. While there are slight variations in specific domain terminology, the core function remains identical: to process batches of ready-to-use data while maintaining state consistency. In every described scenario, 主流程 acts as the main processing path through which preprocessed information is channeled, ensuring that the system operates in a unified and reliable manner.&lt;SEP&gt;The core processing pipeline of the system that handles data after preprocessing, utilizing batch processing and state consistency.&lt;SEP&gt;The main processing flow of the document slicing strategy, where data is processed after preprocessing.&lt;SEP&gt;The primary processing pipeline that handles data after preprocessing in the system.&lt;SEP&gt;The main processing flow that data enters after preprocessing, where batches are processed and state consistency is maintained.&lt;SEP&gt;The primary processing pipeline of the message queue system where data flows after preprocessing.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;The core processing pipeline in streaming computing through which data flows after preprocessing.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1534b76d325a8f591b52d302e7181331-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eae27d77ca20db309e056e3d2dcd7d69-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3644a684f98ea8fe223c713b77189a77-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-757b505cfd34c64c85ca5b5690ee5293-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a597e50502f5ff68e3e25b9114205d4a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f1de29e6da19d22b51c68001e7e0e54-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8ffe9a587b126f152ed3d89a146b445-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c56ff4ce4aaf9573aa5dff913df997a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da4fb5c6e93e74d3df8527599fa62642-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb160de1de89d9058fcb0b968dbbbd68-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5fd0b37cd7dbbb00f97ba6ce92bf5add-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-73278a4a86960eeb576a8fd4c9ec6997-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f6ffaa6bb0b408017b62254211691b5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-698d51a19d8a121ce581499d7b701668-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5f93f983524def3dca464469d2cf9f3e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3c65c2974270fd093ee8a9bf8ae7d0b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9e1074f5b3f9fc8ea15d152add07294-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6974ce5ac660610b44d9b9fed0ff9548-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-38b3eff8baf56627478ec76a704e9b52-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f899139df5e1059396431415e770c6dd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ac627ab1ccbdb62ec96e702f07f6425b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed3d2c21991e3bef5e069713af9fa6ca-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e2ef524fbf3d9fe611d5a8e90fefdc9c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f4b9ec30ad9f68f89b29639786cb62ef-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98dce83da57b0395e163467c9dae521b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54229abfcfa5649e7003b83dd4755294-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8613985ec49eb8f757ae6439e879bb2a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2a38a4a9316c49e5a833517c45d31070-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c7e1249ffc03eb9ded908c236bd1996d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-68d30a9594728bc39aa24be94b319d21-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9778d5d219c5080b9a6a17bef029331c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f033ab37c30201f73f142449d037028d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1fe173d08e959397adf34b1d77e88d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35f4a8d465e6e1edc05f3d8ab658c551-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d09bf41544a3365a46c9077ebb5e35c3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad61ab143223efbc24c7d2583be69251-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-32bb90e8976aab5298d5da10fe66f21d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7cbbc409ec990f19c78c75bd1e06f215-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3f390d88e4c41f2747bfa2f1b5f87db-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3295c76acbf4caaed33c36b1b5fc2cb1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f041e16a60928b05a7e228a89c3799-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9f61408e3afb633e50cdf1b20de6f466-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a684eceee76fc522773286a895bc8436-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d82c8d1619ad8176d665453cfb2e55f0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a1158154dfa42caddbd0694a4e9bdc8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c0c7c76d30bd3dcaefc96f40275bdc0a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-642e92efb79421734881b53e1e1b18b6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d9d4f495e875a2e075a1a4a6e1b9770f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6c8349cc7260ae62e3b1396831a8398f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f7177163c833dff4b38fc8d2872f1ec6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a1d0c6e83f027327d8461063f4ac58a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-17e62166fc8586dfa4d1bc0e1742c08b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3416a75f4cea9109507cacd8e2f2aefc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d645920e395fedad7bbbed0eca3fe2e0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d67d8ab4f4c10bf22aa353e27879133c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5771bce93e200c36f7cd9dfd0e5deaa-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">212&lt;SEP&gt;205&lt;SEP&gt;200&lt;SEP&gt;201&lt;SEP&gt;194&lt;SEP&gt;135&lt;SEP&gt;124&lt;SEP&gt;121&lt;SEP&gt;120&lt;SEP&gt;117&lt;SEP&gt;114&lt;SEP&gt;113&lt;SEP&gt;112&lt;SEP&gt;111&lt;SEP&gt;110&lt;SEP&gt;108&lt;SEP&gt;104&lt;SEP&gt;103&lt;SEP&gt;101&lt;SEP&gt;100&lt;SEP&gt;99&lt;SEP&gt;98&lt;SEP&gt;97&lt;SEP&gt;94&lt;SEP&gt;93&lt;SEP&gt;91&lt;SEP&gt;90&lt;SEP&gt;88&lt;SEP&gt;87&lt;SEP&gt;84&lt;SEP&gt;82&lt;SEP&gt;80&lt;SEP&gt;79&lt;SEP&gt;78&lt;SEP&gt;75&lt;SEP&gt;74&lt;SEP&gt;72&lt;SEP&gt;70&lt;SEP&gt;68&lt;SEP&gt;66&lt;SEP&gt;58&lt;SEP&gt;56&lt;SEP&gt;54&lt;SEP&gt;53&lt;SEP&gt;52&lt;SEP&gt;50&lt;SEP&gt;48&lt;SEP&gt;46&lt;SEP&gt;45&lt;SEP&gt;44&lt;SEP&gt;42&lt;SEP&gt;43&lt;SEP&gt;41&lt;SEP&gt;40&lt;SEP&gt;39&lt;SEP&gt;38</data>
