<node id="Dependency Services">
  <data key="d0">Dependency Services</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Services that the evaluation benchmark system relies on for its operations, which may occasionally experience failures.&lt;SEP&gt;Dependency Services are external or internal systems on which Consistent Hashing frameworks rely for operations.</data>
