<node id="状态一致性">
  <data key="d0">状态一致性</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">状态一致性 (State Consistency) is a fundamental principle and property in computing systems, particularly within stream computing, data processing, and distributed environments. It refers to the ability of a system to maintain a synchronized and uniform state—both in terms of system state and data state—across all processes and distributed components during batch operations. This ensures that the internal status of the system remains aligned with the data being processed, thereby guaranteeing the accuracy, reliability, and correctness of the final processing results.

In practical applications, 状态一致性 is a critical requirement in workflows such as batch processing, query rewriting, data masking systems, semantic caching systems, and embedding model systems. For instance, in vector databases, stream computing systems, and multi-channel recall systems, it ensures that state transitions are coherent throughout the entire batch, preventing partial updates or inconsistencies that could lead to erroneous outputs. The principle is also closely tied to "重排序" (reordering) processes, where maintaining a consistent state is essential for preserving the integrity of ordered operations. Additionally, the system must uphold this consistency under varying load conditions, ensuring robust performance even in high-throughput scenarios.

Overall, 状态一致性 serves as a key design constraint and quality benchmark, ensuring that systems can handle large-scale data operations without drifting into inconsistent or unreliable states. It underscores the need for robust state management mechanisms, especially in distributed or high-throughput environments where multiple processes must converge on a single, accurate system view. This principle is also maintained by evaluation benchmark systems, which rely on it to guarantee that batch processing preserves consistent system state across all operations. Furthermore, it is a central goal in message queue reliability design, where ensuring data state consistency during message processing is a primary objective.&lt;SEP&gt;The state consistency maintained by the system when processing data in batches within the document slicing strategy.&lt;SEP&gt;The maintained consistency of system state during batch processing in the main flow.&lt;SEP&gt;The maintenance of consistent state across the system during batch processing.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;A key property maintained by the streaming computing system when processing data in batches.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1534b76d325a8f591b52d302e7181331-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-854d6fae5ee42911677c739ee1734486-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-02522a2b2726fb0a03bb19f2d8d9524d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f1de29e6da19d22b51c68001e7e0e54-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3def184ad8f4755ff269862ea77393dd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-202cb962ac59075b964b07152d234b70-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c56ff4ce4aaf9573aa5dff913df997a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da4fb5c6e93e74d3df8527599fa62642-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb160de1de89d9058fcb0b968dbbbd68-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b44928ae11fb9384c4cf38708677c48-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5fd0b37cd7dbbb00f97ba6ce92bf5add-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-698d51a19d8a121ce581499d7b701668-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5f93f983524def3dca464469d2cf9f3e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-65b9eea6e1cc6bb9f0cd2a47751a186f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0935e4cd5920aa6c7c996a5ee53a70f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9e1074f5b3f9fc8ea15d152add07294-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ec8956637a99787bd197eacd77acce5e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6974ce5ac660610b44d9b9fed0ff9548-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f899139df5e1059396431415e770c6dd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ac627ab1ccbdb62ec96e702f07f6425b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f4b9ec30ad9f68f89b29639786cb62ef-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54229abfcfa5649e7003b83dd4755294-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2a38a4a9316c49e5a833517c45d31070-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c7e1249ffc03eb9ded908c236bd1996d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-68d30a9594728bc39aa24be94b319d21-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f033ab37c30201f73f142449d037028d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35f4a8d465e6e1edc05f3d8ab658c551-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d09bf41544a3365a46c9077ebb5e35c3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad61ab143223efbc24c7d2583be69251-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d2ddea18f00665ce8623e36bd4e3c7c5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-32bb90e8976aab5298d5da10fe66f21d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3f390d88e4c41f2747bfa2f1b5f87db-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fc490ca45c00b1249bbe3554a4fdf6fb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-03afdbd66e7929b125f8597834fa83a4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f041e16a60928b05a7e228a89c3799-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b53b3a3d6ab90ce0268229151c9bde11-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a684eceee76fc522773286a895bc8436-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2838023a778dfaecdc212708f721b788-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c0c7c76d30bd3dcaefc96f40275bdc0a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a1158154dfa42caddbd0694a4e9bdc8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f457c545a9ded88f18ecee47145a72c0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-642e92efb79421734881b53e1e1b18b6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6c8349cc7260ae62e3b1396831a8398f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f7177163c833dff4b38fc8d2872f1ec6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-17e62166fc8586dfa4d1bc0e1742c08b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d645920e395fedad7bbbed0eca3fe2e0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d67d8ab4f4c10bf22aa353e27879133c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5771bce93e200c36f7cd9dfd0e5deaa-chunk-000</data>
