<node id="Multi-Channel Recall">
  <data key="d0">Multi-Channel Recall</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A core concept in modern systems referring to the mechanisms used to handle and process data in batches, ensuring state consistency, managing concurrency, and controlling traffic with queue buffering.</data>
