</node>
<node id="Network Round-Trip Delay">
  <data key="d0">Network Round-Trip Delay</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The time taken for a network request to travel to its destination and back, a critical factor in system performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Network round-trip delay refers to the time taken for a network request to travel to a remote service and return, impacting system performance.&lt;SEP&gt;A measure of the time taken for a request to travel to a remote service and back within the context of semantic caching.&lt;SEP&gt;The total time it takes for a data packet to travel from a source to a destination and back, often used as a key metric for evaluating communication efficiency in distributed systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6f3ef77ac0e3619e98159e9b6febf557-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b1d10e7bafa4421218a51b1e1f1b0ba2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-31fefc0e570cb3860f2a6d4b38c6490d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1afa34a7f984eeabdbb0a7d494132ee5-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">210&lt;SEP&gt;209&lt;SEP&gt;187&lt;SEP&gt;131</data>
  <data key="d5">1788256337</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Batch Processing">
  <data key="d0">Batch Processing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Batch Processing is a data handling method that groups data into batches for processing, a technique widely recognized for improving efficiency, optimizing system throughput, and maintaining state consistency during operations. It is commonly applied across diverse systems and methodologies, including distributed systems, data masking, consistent hashing, and specialized strategies like the Document Slicing Strategy, where data is divided into predefined batches to ensure stable system behavior. The mechanism is also integral to query rewriting processes and evaluation benchmarks, where it enables organized data management, supports accurate assessments, and contributes to both efficiency and consistency in modern system designs.

Within the context of document sharding workflows, Batch Processing serves as a mechanism where the system processes data in batches while preserving state consistency, ensuring performance under load. It represents the main processing flow that handles data batches across operations, maintaining a controlled and systematic methodology. This approach is particularly valuable in scenarios that require operational stability and reliable performance, as it establishes a structured framework for data operations. By processing data in groups, Batch Processing bolsters state consistency and system throughput, making it a foundational technique for applications that demand orderly and dependable data processing.&lt;SEP&gt;A processing approach in distributed index systems where data is handled in batches while maintaining state consistency.&lt;SEP&gt;The data processing approach used by the vector database in its main workflow, where data is handled in batches.&lt;SEP&gt;The approach of processing data in batches within the main flow while maintaining state consistency.&lt;SEP&gt;A processing approach where the system handles data in batches while maintaining state consistency.&lt;SEP&gt;The system processes data in batches and maintains state consistency during operation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6f3ef77ac0e3619e98159e9b6febf557-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b1d10e7bafa4421218a51b1e1f1b0ba2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eabe3a1649ffa2b3ff8c02ebfd5659f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0e65972dce68dad4d52d063967f0a705-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-85d8ce590ad8981ca2c8286f79f59954-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cfecdb276f634854f3ef915e2e980c31-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a2557a7b2e94197ff767970b67041697-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9dcb88e0137649590b755372b040afad-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ec5decca5ed3d6b8079e2e7e7bacc9f2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-069059b7ef840f0c74a814ec9237b6ec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-07e1cd7dca89a1678042477183b7ac3f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-812b4ba287f5ee0bc9d43bbf5bbe87fb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7647966b7343c29048673252e490f736-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3ef815416f775098fe977004015c6193-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28dd2c7955ce926456240b2ff0100bde-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbd7939d674997cdb4692d34de8633c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ea5d2f1c4608232e07d3aa3d998e5135-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f39f8317fbdb1988ef4c628eba02591-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-072b030ba126b2f4b2374f342be9ed44-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-093f65e080a295f8076b1c5722a46aa2-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">210&lt;SEP&gt;209&lt;SEP&gt;206&lt;SEP&gt;198&lt;SEP&gt;197&lt;SEP&gt;190&lt;SEP&gt;189&lt;SEP&gt;188&lt;SEP&gt;127&lt;SEP&gt;126&lt;SEP&gt;119&lt;SEP&gt;95&lt;SEP&gt;89&lt;SEP&gt;85&lt;SEP&gt;77&lt;SEP&gt;76&lt;SEP&gt;64&lt;SEP&gt;61&lt;SEP&gt;60&lt;SEP&gt;59</data>
