<node id="监控">
  <data key="d0">监控</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">监控 (Jiānkòng) is a comprehensive system monitoring process and technical practice focused on observing, measuring, and analyzing core performance metrics—primarily throughput, latency percentiles (or quantiles), and error rates—to ensure system stability, reliability, and operational health. This function is integral to various computing environments, including streaming computation platforms, benchmarking systems, data masking frameworks, consistency hashing systems, multi-channel recall systems, and embedded model engineering practices. In each of these contexts, 监控 involves continuous tracking and review of these three core indicators to validate system performance under different conditions and detect anomalies early.  

Beyond data collection, 监控 performs cause attribution analysis for performance anomalies, particularly identifying root causes for slow queries, which supports performance tuning, reliability assurance, and operational oversight. This systematic approach enables proactive management of operational health, facilitating both immediate issue resolution and long-term optimization efforts. As both a process and a practice, 监控 serves as a critical component for ensuring that systems meet their performance objectives across diverse deployment scenarios, embedding monitoring practices directly into system architecture to maintain expected service levels and support continuous evaluation.&lt;SEP&gt;A practice focusing on throughput, latency percentiles, and error rate metrics, including root cause analysis of slow queries.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-091d584fced301b442654dd8c23b3fc9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3644a684f98ea8fe223c713b77189a77-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-757b505cfd34c64c85ca5b5690ee5293-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9fc3d7152ba9336a670e36d0ed79bc43-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f1de29e6da19d22b51c68001e7e0e54-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8ffe9a587b126f152ed3d89a146b445-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5fd0b37cd7dbbb00f97ba6ce92bf5add-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-698d51a19d8a121ce581499d7b701668-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-65b9eea6e1cc6bb9f0cd2a47751a186f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f899139df5e1059396431415e770c6dd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed3d2c21991e3bef5e069713af9fa6ca-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98dce83da57b0395e163467c9dae521b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2a38a4a9316c49e5a833517c45d31070-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c7e1249ffc03eb9ded908c236bd1996d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad61ab143223efbc24c7d2583be69251-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-14bfa6bb14875e45bba028a21ed38046-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3f390d88e4c41f2747bfa2f1b5f87db-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3295c76acbf4caaed33c36b1b5fc2cb1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9f61408e3afb633e50cdf1b20de6f466-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a1158154dfa42caddbd0694a4e9bdc8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6c8349cc7260ae62e3b1396831a8398f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a1d0c6e83f027327d8461063f4ac58a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5771bce93e200c36f7cd9dfd0e5deaa-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">208&lt;SEP&gt;200&lt;SEP&gt;201&lt;SEP&gt;133&lt;SEP&gt;135&lt;SEP&gt;124&lt;SEP&gt;114&lt;SEP&gt;111&lt;SEP&gt;105&lt;SEP&gt;100&lt;SEP&gt;98&lt;SEP&gt;93&lt;SEP&gt;88&lt;SEP&gt;87&lt;SEP&gt;74&lt;SEP&gt;69&lt;SEP&gt;68&lt;SEP&gt;66&lt;SEP&gt;56&lt;SEP&gt;52&lt;SEP&gt;45&lt;SEP&gt;42&lt;SEP&gt;38</data>
