<node id="前后对比证据链">
  <data key="d0">前后对比证据链</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Evidence generated to compare system states before and after changes.&lt;SEP&gt;A chain of comparative evidence collected before and after changes to validate their impact on embedding model performance.&lt;SEP&gt;A documented set of before-and-after evidence showing the impact of a change in system performance or behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;前后对比证据链refers to evidence chains comparing system parameters and performance metrics before and after changes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-091d584fced301b442654dd8c23b3fc9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a597e50502f5ff68e3e25b9114205d4a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6cdd60ea0045eb7a6ec44c54d29ed402-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1f491a404d6854880943e5c3cd9ca25-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">208&lt;SEP&gt;194&lt;SEP&gt;184&lt;SEP&gt;129</data>
