</node>
<node id="Cache Invalid Storm">
  <data key="d0">Cache Invalid Storm</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Cache invalid storm is a phenomenon where simultaneous cache invalidations lead to system overloads and degraded performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b1d10e7bafa4421218a51b1e1f1b0ba2-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">209</data>
  <data key="d5">1788255984</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Evidence Chains">
  <data key="d0">Evidence Chains</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Evidence chains are documented comparisons of system performance before and after modifications to ensure transparent evaluation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b1d10e7bafa4421218a51b1e1f1b0ba2-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">209</data>
  <data key="d5">1788255984</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="证据链">
  <data key="d0">证据链</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">证据链 (Evidence Chain) is a structured, formal documentation framework designed to capture, preserve, and demonstrate the effects of changes—particularly parameter modifications—on system performance. It serves as a decision-support and validation mechanism in technical change management, ensuring that all alterations are backed by measurable, empirical before-and-after comparison data rather than assumption. The evidence chain must be maintained for every parameter change, forming a continuous and traceable record of system evolution. This requirement applies explicitly to parameter tuning in contexts such as performance engineering, system administration, optimization workflows, and, more specifically, within semantic caching systems, where evidence of before-and-after comparisons is mandatory for changes to be considered valid.

The evidence chain is equally required for any changes made during query rewriting, as well as for any general system modifications, ensuring that all adjustments are objectively justified. By systematically documenting comparisons, the evidence chain facilitates transparency, reproducibility, and informed judgment, enabling stakeholders to review the rationale, execution, and outcome of each modification. Its integrity and availability are critical to confirming that a change achieved its intended effect, thereby supporting accountability and rigorous change control. In practice, the evidence chain functions as both a continuous audit trail and a validation tool, ensuring that tuning decisions and other system changes are verified through demonstrable, preserved comparative evidence across all relevant technical workflows.&lt;SEP&gt;A chain of evidence, including before-and-after comparisons, required for any parameter changes to validate their effect.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-69adc1e107f7f7d035d7baf04342e1ca-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eae27d77ca20db309e056e3d2dcd7d69-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8ffe9a587b126f152ed3d89a146b445-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da4fb5c6e93e74d3df8527599fa62642-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-698d51a19d8a121ce581499d7b701668-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-65b9eea6e1cc6bb9f0cd2a47751a186f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6974ce5ac660610b44d9b9fed0ff9548-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f899139df5e1059396431415e770c6dd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ac627ab1ccbdb62ec96e702f07f6425b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f4b9ec30ad9f68f89b29639786cb62ef-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54229abfcfa5649e7003b83dd4755294-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f033ab37c30201f73f142449d037028d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35f4a8d465e6e1edc05f3d8ab658c551-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d09bf41544a3365a46c9077ebb5e35c3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad61ab143223efbc24c7d2583be69251-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d2ddea18f00665ce8623e36bd4e3c7c5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-32bb90e8976aab5298d5da10fe66f21d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3f390d88e4c41f2747bfa2f1b5f87db-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c0c7c76d30bd3dcaefc96f40275bdc0a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-642e92efb79421734881b53e1e1b18b6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f7177163c833dff4b38fc8d2872f1ec6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a1d0c6e83f027327d8461063f4ac58a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-17e62166fc8586dfa4d1bc0e1742c08b-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">207&lt;SEP&gt;205&lt;SEP&gt;124&lt;SEP&gt;120&lt;SEP&gt;111&lt;SEP&gt;105&lt;SEP&gt;103&lt;SEP&gt;100&lt;SEP&gt;99&lt;SEP&gt;94&lt;SEP&gt;91&lt;SEP&gt;80&lt;SEP&gt;78&lt;SEP&gt;75&lt;SEP&gt;74&lt;SEP&gt;73&lt;SEP&gt;72&lt;SEP&gt;68&lt;SEP&gt;50&lt;SEP&gt;48&lt;SEP&gt;44&lt;SEP&gt;42&lt;SEP&gt;43</data>
  <data key="d5">1788257007</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="系统状态一致性">
  <data key="d0">系统状态一致性</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The consistency of the system's state during operations and data processing.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-69adc1e107f7f7d035d7baf04342e1ca-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">207</data>
  <data key="d5">1788255984</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Monitoring">
  <data key="d0">Monitoring</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Monitoring refers to the process of continuously observing, measuring, and assessing system performance to ensure smooth operation, availability, and reliability. It focuses on tracking key performance indicators such as throughput, latency (frequently represented as latency percentiles), and error rates. This systematic approach is applied across various contexts, including distributed systems, consistent hashing algorithms, document slicing strategies, semantic caching systems, and text compression systems.

Through monitoring, system metrics are evaluated to assess performance, detect potential issues, and maintain stable operation. By measuring critical parameters like throughput—the rate at which processes or data are handled—latency, which indicates response times, and error rates, which measure system faults, monitoring provides the insights necessary to optimize and maintain system health across diverse computational and technological environments.&lt;SEP&gt;Process of tracking throughput, latency percentiles, and error rates as core system metrics.&lt;SEP&gt;The practice of tracking core metrics including throughput, latency percentiles, and error rate in the system.&lt;SEP&gt;The practice of tracking system performance using metrics such as throughput, latency percentiles, and error rates.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b1d10e7bafa4421218a51b1e1f1b0ba2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7eabe3a1649ffa2b3ff8c02ebfd5659f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-84d9ee44e457ddef7f2c4f25dc8fa865-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-85d8ce590ad8981ca2c8286f79f59954-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0336dcbab05b9d5ad24f4333c7658a0e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cfecdb276f634854f3ef915e2e980c31-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-31fefc0e570cb3860f2a6d4b38c6490d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9b8619251a19057cff70779273e95aa6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3ef815416f775098fe977004015c6193-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f39f8317fbdb1988ef4c628eba02591-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-072b030ba126b2f4b2374f342be9ed44-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">209&lt;SEP&gt;206&lt;SEP&gt;199&lt;SEP&gt;197&lt;SEP&gt;195&lt;SEP&gt;190&lt;SEP&gt;187&lt;SEP&gt;130&lt;SEP&gt;85&lt;SEP&gt;61&lt;SEP&gt;60</data>
  <data key="d5">1788256843</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="数据预处理">
  <data key="d0">数据预处理</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">数据预处理（Data Preprocessing）是数据处理架构中的一个基础且关键的初始阶段，广泛存在于多种技术系统中。其核心职能是在原始数据进入系统主处理流程（如批次处理、流式计算、多路径召回、知识图谱工作流、联邦学习、嵌入模型、检索增强生成系统、语义缓存或文档切片策略）之前，对数据进行一系列准备与标准化操作。该过程通常涉及数据清洗（如去除噪声和异常值）、转换（如统一格式和特征工程）以及组织（如排序和结构化），旨在将原始数据转化为符合后续处理要求的高质量、一致性强的格式。

作为流程的“守门人”，数据预处理确保了进入主处理逻辑的数据具备可靠性，从而避免原始数据中的不一致性或噪声对计算结果、模型训练或分析任务产生负面影响。在具体应用中，数据预处理是嵌入模型工作流、联邦学习系统、一致哈希系统和流式计算管道的前置阶段；在向量数据库主流程中，它紧接数据输入之后、批次处理之前执行；在检索增强生成系统中，它作为数据进入主工作流前的准备步骤；在语义缓存和文档切片策略中，它同样作为内部机制的一部分，在数据进入主流程前进行预处理。此外，在重排序过程中，数据预处理也是一项必要的准备步骤，确保数据在进入主工作流前得到适当处理。

无论是作为多路径召回系统的起始环节，还是知识图谱系统的准备步骤，数据预处理的共同目标都是提升数据质量，为后续的模型嵌入、聚合计算或分析任务奠定坚实基础。预处理的结果直接影响系统后续工作的效率与准确性，因此是各类数据处理架构中不可或缺的基础组件。在具体技术环境中，例如在一致哈希管道中，数据预处理作为初始步骤保证了一致性和正确性；在熔断降级的原理讨论中，它也被视为内部机制的一部分。总之，数据预处理是数据进入任何主流程前的必备环节，其作用贯穿于系统架构的多个层面，确保后续处理的高效与可靠。&lt;SEP&gt;数据进入嵌入模型主流程前所经历的处理过程，是嵌入模型工作流程的起始环节。&lt;SEP&gt;A process that prepares data before it enters the main flow of the retrieval-augmented generation system.&lt;SEP&gt;The preliminary step in the data processing flow before entering the main process in the system.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of preparing data before it enters the main processing flow.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of preparing data before it enters the main message queue workflow.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-69adc1e107f7f7d035d7baf04342e1ca-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eae27d77ca20db309e056e3d2dcd7d69-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-084b6fbb10729ed4da8c3d3f5a3ae7c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a597e50502f5ff68e3e25b9114205d4a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3def184ad8f4755ff269862ea77393dd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8ffe9a587b126f152ed3d89a146b445-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-202cb962ac59075b964b07152d234b70-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da4fb5c6e93e74d3df8527599fa62642-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f6ffaa6bb0b408017b62254211691b5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-698d51a19d8a121ce581499d7b701668-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2723d092b63885e0d7c260cc007e8b9d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-65b9eea6e1cc6bb9f0cd2a47751a186f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed3d2c21991e3bef5e069713af9fa6ca-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92cc227532d17e56e07902b254dfad10-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8613985ec49eb8f757ae6439e879bb2a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2a38a4a9316c49e5a833517c45d31070-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-93db85ed909c13838ff95ccfa94cebd9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1fe173d08e959397adf34b1d77e88d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35f4a8d465e6e1edc05f3d8ab658c551-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-32bb90e8976aab5298d5da10fe66f21d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-14bfa6bb14875e45bba028a21ed38046-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-735b90b4568125ed6c3f678819b6e058-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3f390d88e4c41f2747bfa2f1b5f87db-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3295c76acbf4caaed33c36b1b5fc2cb1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-03afdbd66e7929b125f8597834fa83a4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-72b32a1f754ba1c09b3695e0cb6cde7f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2838023a778dfaecdc212708f721b788-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f457c545a9ded88f18ecee47145a72c0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d9d4f495e875a2e075a1a4a6e1b9770f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6c8349cc7260ae62e3b1396831a8398f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a1d0c6e83f027327d8461063f4ac58a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3416a75f4cea9109507cacd8e2f2aefc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d645920e395fedad7bbbed0eca3fe2e0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d67d8ab4f4c10bf22aa353e27879133c-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">207&lt;SEP&gt;205&lt;SEP&gt;196&lt;SEP&gt;194&lt;SEP&gt;125&lt;SEP&gt;124&lt;SEP&gt;123&lt;SEP&gt;120&lt;SEP&gt;112&lt;SEP&gt;111&lt;SEP&gt;109&lt;SEP&gt;105&lt;SEP&gt;98&lt;SEP&gt;92&lt;SEP&gt;90&lt;SEP&gt;88&lt;SEP&gt;86&lt;SEP&gt;79&lt;SEP&gt;78&lt;SEP&gt;72&lt;SEP&gt;69&lt;SEP&gt;67&lt;SEP&gt;68&lt;SEP&gt;66&lt;SEP&gt;63&lt;SEP&gt;57&lt;SEP&gt;51&lt;SEP&gt;49&lt;SEP&gt;46&lt;SEP&gt;45&lt;SEP&gt;42&lt;SEP&gt;41&lt;SEP&gt;40&lt;SEP&gt;39</data>
