</node>
<node id="High Remote Service Round-Trip Delay">
  <data key="d0">High Remote Service Round-Trip Delay</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">An issue where remote service communication delays are abnormally high, impacting system performance.&lt;SEP&gt;A challenge in distributed systems where the total time required for data to travel to and from remote services becomes excessively high.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-274ad4786c3abca69fa097b85867d9a4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-85d8ce590ad8981ca2c8286f79f59954-chunk-000</data>
