</node>
<node id="检索增强生成">
  <data key="d0">检索增强生成</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A concept describing a modern technique that plays a key role in systems by using enhanced retrieval processes combined with generation mechanisms to process data, maintain state consistency, and ensure availability under high load conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;A concept in modern systems that enhances generation by retrieving relevant information, playing a key role in system architecture and engineering practices.&lt;SEP&gt;A technology combining retrieval with generative models to enhance response quality using external knowledge sources.&lt;SEP&gt;A core concept combining retrieval-based and generative methods, described as playing a key role in modern systems.&lt;SEP&gt;A core concept in modern systems, encompassing principles and implementation for enhancing generation through retrieval.&lt;SEP&gt;A modern system concept that plays a key role in processing data through preprocessing, batch handling, and state consistency maintenance under load and service dependencies.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e2c0be24560d78c5e599c2a9c9d0bbd2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a97da629b098b75c294dffdc3e463904-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-93db85ed909c13838ff95ccfa94cebd9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3295c76acbf4caaed33c36b1b5fc2cb1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d82c8d1619ad8176d665453cfb2e55f0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a1d0c6e83f027327d8461063f4ac58a6-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">203&lt;SEP&gt;107&lt;SEP&gt;86&lt;SEP&gt;66&lt;SEP&gt;53&lt;SEP&gt;42</data>
  <data key="d5">1788257004</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="流式计算">
  <data key="d0">流式计算</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A computational paradigm essential in modern systems that processes and maintains consistency of data in batches while ensuring smooth flow control and fault tolerance during peak loads.&lt;SEP&gt;A modern computing paradigm that processes data in streams, playing a critical role in modern systems through batch processing, state consistency maintenance, and handling varying loads.&lt;SEP&gt;A computing paradigm for processing data streams in real-time, covering core concepts, architecture, and engineering practices described in the document.&lt;SEP&gt;A computational paradigm described in the test document that processes data in batches while maintaining state consistency, with mechanisms for handling load spikes and service dependencies.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;A modern system concept that processes data in batches while maintaining state consistency and handling load through concurrency control, queue buffering, retries, and degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;A computing paradigm in modern systems that processes data in batches while maintaining state consistency, handling load spikes through concurrency control and queue buffering, and ensuring availability via retries and degradation when dependency services fail.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3644a684f98ea8fe223c713b77189a77-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-202cb962ac59075b964b07152d234b70-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-65b9eea6e1cc6bb9f0cd2a47751a186f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-43ec517d68b6edd3015b3edc9a11367b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fc490ca45c00b1249bbe3554a4fdf6fb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5771bce93e200c36f7cd9dfd0e5deaa-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">200&lt;SEP&gt;123&lt;SEP&gt;105&lt;SEP&gt;81&lt;SEP&gt;65&lt;SEP&gt;38</data>
  <data key="d5">1788257034</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="预处理">
  <data key="d0">预处理</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">预处理 (Preprocessing) is a foundational and universally applied step in data processing pipelines, defined as the preliminary operations performed on raw data before it enters the main workflow. Its core purpose is to prepare, clean, format, and transform data, thereby enhancing its quality, consistency, and suitability for downstream tasks, which is critical for improving the efficiency and accuracy of subsequent processes. This step acts as an essential bridge between raw input and core processing logic across diverse computing contexts, including streaming computation, data masking, inverted index systems, retrieval-augmented generation systems, message queues, and word segmentation algorithms.

In practice, preprocessing readies data for specific purposes: in an inverted index system (倒排索引), it prepares data for indexing; in a query rewriting flow, it serves as the preliminary step before the main rewriting process; and within an evaluation benchmark framework (评估基准), it prepares data before entering the main processing flow. It is also described as a data preparation step within retrieval-augmented generation, a standardization or cleaning stage for data entering a message queue, and an initial processing stage in data masking workflows. Within internal mechanisms such as熔断降级, preprocessing is noted as a step that occurs before the main data flow.

Additionally, preprocessing is identified as the front-end step in text compression systems (文本压缩系统), where data passes through it before entering the main process, and as a stage that precedes the main pipeline in systems like semantic caching and re-ranking (重排序). In multi-channel recall systems, preprocessing ensures data is ready for batch processing before entering the main workflow. In knowledge graph systems, it cleans and prepares raw data before the main processing flow, and in vector database systems, it is the first stage of the system’s processing pipeline. Descriptions in both English and Chinese consistently refer to 预处理 as the “前置处理步骤” (pre-processing step) or the “数据进入主流程前的准备阶段” (preparation stage before data enters the main flow), confirming its universal role as a critical, preliminary stage in data handling, ensuring that data is optimized for the specific requirements of the main processing flow.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of preparing data before it enters the main flow in the document slicing strategy.&lt;SEP&gt;The initial data processing step before the main flow in streaming computing systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3644a684f98ea8fe223c713b77189a77-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-854d6fae5ee42911677c739ee1734486-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c56ff4ce4aaf9573aa5dff913df997a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb160de1de89d9058fcb0b968dbbbd68-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b44928ae11fb9384c4cf38708677c48-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5fd0b37cd7dbbb00f97ba6ce92bf5add-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-73278a4a86960eeb576a8fd4c9ec6997-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5f93f983524def3dca464469d2cf9f3e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3c65c2974270fd093ee8a9bf8ae7d0b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a97da629b098b75c294dffdc3e463904-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9e1074f5b3f9fc8ea15d152add07294-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6974ce5ac660610b44d9b9fed0ff9548-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ec8956637a99787bd197eacd77acce5e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-38b3eff8baf56627478ec76a704e9b52-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f899139df5e1059396431415e770c6dd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ac627ab1ccbdb62ec96e702f07f6425b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e2ef524fbf3d9fe611d5a8e90fefdc9c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f4b9ec30ad9f68f89b29639786cb62ef-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98dce83da57b0395e163467c9dae521b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-54229abfcfa5649e7003b83dd4755294-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c7e1249ffc03eb9ded908c236bd1996d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-68d30a9594728bc39aa24be94b319d21-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f033ab37c30201f73f142449d037028d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad61ab143223efbc24c7d2583be69251-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d2ddea18f00665ce8623e36bd4e3c7c5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7cbbc409ec990f19c78c75bd1e06f215-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fc490ca45c00b1249bbe3554a4fdf6fb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f041e16a60928b05a7e228a89c3799-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9f61408e3afb633e50cdf1b20de6f466-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a684eceee76fc522773286a895bc8436-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d82c8d1619ad8176d665453cfb2e55f0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a1158154dfa42caddbd0694a4e9bdc8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c0c7c76d30bd3dcaefc96f40275bdc0a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-642e92efb79421734881b53e1e1b18b6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-67c6a1e7ce56d3d6fa748ab6d9af3fd7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f7177163c833dff4b38fc8d2872f1ec6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-17e62166fc8586dfa4d1bc0e1742c08b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5771bce93e200c36f7cd9dfd0e5deaa-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">200&lt;SEP&gt;202&lt;SEP&gt;121&lt;SEP&gt;117&lt;SEP&gt;115&lt;SEP&gt;114&lt;SEP&gt;113&lt;SEP&gt;110&lt;SEP&gt;108&lt;SEP&gt;107&lt;SEP&gt;104&lt;SEP&gt;103&lt;SEP&gt;102&lt;SEP&gt;101&lt;SEP&gt;100&lt;SEP&gt;99&lt;SEP&gt;97&lt;SEP&gt;94&lt;SEP&gt;93&lt;SEP&gt;91&lt;SEP&gt;87&lt;SEP&gt;84&lt;SEP&gt;80&lt;SEP&gt;74&lt;SEP&gt;73&lt;SEP&gt;70&lt;SEP&gt;65&lt;SEP&gt;58&lt;SEP&gt;56&lt;SEP&gt;54&lt;SEP&gt;53&lt;SEP&gt;52&lt;SEP&gt;50&lt;SEP&gt;48&lt;SEP&gt;47&lt;SEP&gt;44&lt;SEP&gt;43&lt;SEP&gt;38</data>
