<node id="远程服务网络往返延迟过高">
  <data key="d0">远程服务网络往返延迟过高</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">远程服务网络往返延迟过高 (Remote Service Network Round-Trip Latency Excessive) is a performance issue characterized by abnormally high network round-trip delays when a system communicates with remote services. This condition arises during service requests and leads to significant communication lag, which in turn degrades overall system performance. The core problem involves the time it takes for a request to travel from the source system to the remote service and for the response to return, with this round-trip time becoming excessively high. This delay can stem from network congestion, poor connectivity, or server-side bottlenecks, and it directly impacts the efficiency and responsiveness of dependent applications.

The issue is particularly prevalent in streaming computation environments, where real-time data processing is critical and any added latency can disrupt the timely flow of information. Additionally, it is a common challenge in multichannel recall systems, where the system must query multiple remote services simultaneously; excessive latency in these communications can bottleneck the entire recall process. This condition represents a common practical difficulty that must be addressed to maintain reliable and efficient operations in systems reliant on remote service interactions, particularly those involving high-throughput or latency-sensitive tasks such as streaming and multi-source data retrieval.

In practice, this problem is widely recognized and consistently affects performance by causing slower response times and potential timeouts. It is commonly flagged as a concern for system performance and needs to be exposed through load testing before deployment to ensure systems can handle expected traffic and avoid latency-related failures in production.&lt;SEP&gt;A common problem in practice that needs to be exposed through stress testing.&lt;SEP&gt;实践中常见的系统问题之一，需通过压测在上线前暴露。&lt;SEP&gt;嵌入模型实践中常见的问题之一，指依赖的远程服务网络延迟过高，需要通过压测在上线前暴露。&lt;SEP&gt;A common practical problem in streaming computing systems involving high network round-trip latency to remote services.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3644a684f98ea8fe223c713b77189a77-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-854d6fae5ee42911677c739ee1734486-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9872ed9fc22fc182d371c3e9ed316094-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8ffe9a587b126f152ed3d89a146b445-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ef059938ba799aaa845e1c2e8a762bd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-73278a4a86960eeb576a8fd4c9ec6997-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-698d51a19d8a121ce581499d7b701668-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-65b9eea6e1cc6bb9f0cd2a47751a186f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f899139df5e1059396431415e770c6dd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e2ef524fbf3d9fe611d5a8e90fefdc9c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98dce83da57b0395e163467c9dae521b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8613985ec49eb8f757ae6439e879bb2a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-68d30a9594728bc39aa24be94b319d21-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3f390d88e4c41f2747bfa2f1b5f87db-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-72b32a1f754ba1c09b3695e0cb6cde7f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b53b3a3d6ab90ce0268229151c9bde11-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f457c545a9ded88f18ecee47145a72c0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6c8349cc7260ae62e3b1396831a8398f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5771bce93e200c36f7cd9dfd0e5deaa-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">200&lt;SEP&gt;202&lt;SEP&gt;186&lt;SEP&gt;124&lt;SEP&gt;118&lt;SEP&gt;113&lt;SEP&gt;111&lt;SEP&gt;105&lt;SEP&gt;100&lt;SEP&gt;97&lt;SEP&gt;93&lt;SEP&gt;90&lt;SEP&gt;84&lt;SEP&gt;68&lt;SEP&gt;57&lt;SEP&gt;55&lt;SEP&gt;49&lt;SEP&gt;45&lt;SEP&gt;38</data>
