  <data key="d2">A practice of simulating extreme conditions prior to deployment to expose potential system issues.&lt;SEP&gt;A practice conducted before deployment to expose potential issues including cache invalidation storms, connection pool exhaustion, and high network latency.&lt;SEP&gt;A practice used to expose common problems in distributed index systems before deployment, such as cache invalidation storms and connection pool exhaustion.</data>
