<node id="重试与降级机制">
  <data key="d0">重试与降级机制</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A set of techniques used to ensure system availability by automatically retrying failed requests or providing reduced functionality in case of service degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;The strategies applied when dependent services fail, using retry logic and graceful degradation to maintain availability.</data>
