  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">实测数据refers to empirical data collected during testing and system observation, which is used for parameter tuning.&lt;SEP&gt;实测数据represents the data collected from actual testing scenarios, used for parameter tuning and system optimization.&lt;SEP&gt;Measured data derived from load testing and real-world observations, used as the basis for parameter tuning.&lt;SEP&gt;实测数据是指在测试或运行过程中实际测得的数据，用于指导参数调优和决策。&lt;SEP&gt;Measured data obtained from actual system performance testing, used as the basis for parameter tuning decisions in the data masking system.&lt;SEP&gt;Measured data that serves as the basis for parameter tuning decisions in the system.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;Actual measured data used for parameter tuning decisions.</data>
