<node id="Retry">
  <data key="d0">Retry</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">An error-handling approach that attempts an operation multiple times if it initially fails, often used to ensure system availability during temporary failures of dependent services.&lt;SEP&gt;A fault-handling approach used to ensure availability when dependent services encounter anomalies.&lt;SEP&gt;A mechanism used to ensure availability when dependent services encounter exceptions.</data>
