<node id="网络往返延迟">
  <data key="d0">网络往返延迟</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A measurement of the time taken for a data packet to travel to a remote service and back again.&lt;SEP&gt;A common problem in semantic caching involving high network round-trip latency for remote services, which can impact overall system performance.&lt;SEP&gt;远程服务通信中的网络延迟问题，过高会导致系统性能下降，需要通过压测在上线前暴露。&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-76dc611d6ebaafc66cc0879c71b5db5c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-32bb90e8976aab5298d5da10fe66f21d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f7177163c833dff4b38fc8d2872f1ec6-chunk-000</data>
