<node id="压测生成文档">
  <data key="d0">压测生成文档</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">压测生成文档is a document generated during stress testing, specifically for Stage 4 batch import performance testing.&lt;SEP&gt;A load-test-generated document used for Stage 4 batch import performance testing.&lt;SEP&gt;A load testing generated document used for Stage 4 bulk import performance testing.&lt;SEP&gt;A document generated through stress testing for Stage 4 batch import performance testing.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;A document generated from stress testing, used for Stage 4 batch import performance testing.&lt;SEP&gt;A document generated by stress testing for the purpose of Stage 4 batch import performance testing.&lt;SEP&gt;A load-testing-generated document (test document 026) used for Stage 4 batch import performance testing, describing semantic caching technology.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1f491a404d6854880943e5c3cd9ca25-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb160de1de89d9058fcb0b968dbbbd68-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f4b9ec30ad9f68f89b29639786cb62ef-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98dce83da57b0395e163467c9dae521b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d09bf41544a3365a46c9077ebb5e35c3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fc490ca45c00b1249bbe3554a4fdf6fb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c0c7c76d30bd3dcaefc96f40275bdc0a-chunk-000</data>
