<node id="Stage 4批量导入性能测试">
  <data key="d0">Stage 4批量导入性能测试</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Stage 4批量导入性能测试 (Stage 4 Batch Import Performance Test) is a structured performance and load testing phase within a staged deployment process, designed to evaluate and validate a system's ability to handle bulk data ingestion operations under stress conditions, particularly within a vector database environment. The test focuses on how the system manages high-volume data imports efficiently, reliably, and without bottlenecks, ensuring robust processing capabilities during large-scale data transfers.

Its primary purposes are to verify system behavior and performance under load, confirm overall system capacity and operational correctness, and validate the document slicing strategy. Additionally, the load test aims to expose potential issues before go-live, such as cache invalidation storms, connection pool exhaustion, and high network round-trip latency to remote services.

During this phase, generated documentation is imported in batches, producing test documents that serve dual purposes: validating system performance and confirming the effectiveness of the document slicing strategy. These documents were generated specifically for this batch import performance test and act as test data and load test material to identify potential bottlenecks and evaluate system capacity under bulk import scenarios. Specific test documents generated from stress testing include 测试文档063, 测试文档067, 测试文档089, and 测试文档055; other test documents created for this phase include 测试文档046 and 测试文档039.

The test confirmation is centered specifically on batch import performance at Stage 4, with all generated stress-test documents utilized for system validation. This reinforces the suitability of the system for staged deployment by confirming reliable performance under bulk import scenarios. Overall, this phase serves as a critical validation step, ensuring the system can handle bulk import demands while maintaining stability and correctness, and it is explicitly used as the purpose for generating test documents to test throughput and system behavior under load.&lt;SEP&gt;A performance testing phase for batch import, for which the test document was generated.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d1f491a404d6854880943e5c3cd9ca25-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3def184ad8f4755ff269862ea77393dd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8ffe9a587b126f152ed3d89a146b445-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a0a080f42e6f13b3a2df133f073095dd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4c56ff4ce4aaf9573aa5dff913df997a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da4fb5c6e93e74d3df8527599fa62642-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ef059938ba799aaa845e1c2e8a762bd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb160de1de89d9058fcb0b968dbbbd68-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b44928ae11fb9384c4cf38708677c48-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5fd0b37cd7dbbb00f97ba6ce92bf5add-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-73278a4a86960eeb576a8fd4c9ec6997-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-698d51a19d8a121ce581499d7b701668-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5f93f983524def3dca464469d2cf9f3e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2723d092b63885e0d7c260cc007e8b9d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3c65c2974270fd093ee8a9bf8ae7d0b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a97da629b098b75c294dffdc3e463904-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9e1074f5b3f9fc8ea15d152add07294-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6974ce5ac660610b44d9b9fed0ff9548-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-38b3eff8baf56627478ec76a704e9b52-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ac627ab1ccbdb62ec96e702f07f6425b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed3d2c21991e3bef5e069713af9fa6ca-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f4b9ec30ad9f68f89b29639786cb62ef-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92cc227532d17e56e07902b254dfad10-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98dce83da57b0395e163467c9dae521b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8613985ec49eb8f757ae6439e879bb2a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2a38a4a9316c49e5a833517c45d31070-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c7e1249ffc03eb9ded908c236bd1996d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-93db85ed909c13838ff95ccfa94cebd9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-68d30a9594728bc39aa24be94b319d21-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-43ec517d68b6edd3015b3edc9a11367b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f033ab37c30201f73f142449d037028d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35f4a8d465e6e1edc05f3d8ab658c551-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-28dd2c7955ce926456240b2ff0100bde-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d09bf41544a3365a46c9077ebb5e35c3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ad61ab143223efbc24c7d2583be69251-chunk-00