<node id="一致性哈希">
  <data key="d0">一致性哈希</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A technical concept in distributed systems for distributing data across nodes, discussed in the test document.&lt;SEP&gt;一致性哈希是一种现代系统中的关键概念，用于在分布式环境中实现数据分布与负载均衡的核心技术。&lt;SEP&gt;A core concept in modern systems that maps data to nodes consistently to minimize remapping when the node set changes, discussed across sections in the document for principles, implementation, and engineering practice.&lt;SEP&gt;A key mechanism in modern systems for distributing data and maintaining state consistency, discussed across multiple sections of the document.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8ffe9a587b126f152ed3d89a146b445-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6974ce5ac660610b44d9b9fed0ff9548-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3f390d88e4c41f2747bfa2f1b5f87db-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3416a75f4cea9109507cacd8e2f2aefc-chunk-000</data>
