<node id="分词算法">
  <data key="d0">分词算法</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A core algorithm discussed in the document, focusing on internal mechanisms, engineering practices, and performance considerations such as batch processing, concurrency control, and monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;A word segmentation algorithm discussed in the document, covering its core concepts, architecture, and engineering practices.&lt;SEP&gt;A core algorithm discussed in the document, focusing on its principles, architecture, and engineering practices in modern systems.&lt;SEP&gt;A core algorithm concept discussed in the document, covering its principles, architecture, and engineering practices. It handles data preprocessing, main flow processing, batch processing, state consistency, concurrency control, queue buffering, retry, and degradation mechanisms.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-5ef059938ba799aaa845e1c2e8a762bd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-38b3eff8baf56627478ec76a704e9b52-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35f4a8d465e6e1edc05f3d8ab658c551-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9f61408e3afb633e50cdf1b20de6f466-chunk-000</data>
