<node id="Degradation">
  <data key="d0">Degradation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A strategy used to maintain availability when dependent services experience failures.&lt;SEP&gt;A fault-tolerance strategy that reduces service quality or functionality when dependency services fail, ensuring basic availability.&lt;SEP&gt;A fault-handling strategy for maintaining availability when dependent services fail.&lt;SEP&gt;A fallback strategy that ensures system availability when dependent services fail.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-26657d5ff9020d2abefe558796b99584-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-812b4ba287f5ee0bc9d43bbf5bbe87fb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbd7939d674997cdb4692d34de8633c4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-093f65e080a295f8076b1c5722a46aa2-chunk-000</data>
