<edge source="重排序" target="并发控制">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The concept "重排序" utilizes concurrency control techniques to manage batch data processing and handle system load increases.&lt;SEP&gt;重排序通过并发控制平滑高负载流量。&lt;SEP&gt;The重排序system employs并发控制to smooth traffic when system load rises.&lt;SEP&gt;The reordering system uses concurrency control to smooth traffic when load rises.&lt;SEP&gt;在高负载时通过并发控制平滑流量。</data>
