<edge source="压测" target="远程服务网络往返延迟过高">
  <data key="d7">14.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Stress testing (压测) is a performance validation practice used to expose issues related to excessively high network round-trip latency when communicating with remote services. This type of testing is conducted before launch or deployment to identify and surface such latency problems in a controlled environment. The primary purpose of these tests is to reveal that high remote service network round-trip delays are a common and significant issue that needs to be addressed prior to making a system available for production use. By applying load and stress conditions, the testing process uncovers performance bottlenecks and delays, ensuring that network-related performance concerns are understood and mitigated before the system goes live.&lt;SEP&gt;Excessive remote service network round-trip latency is a problem that needs to be revealed by load testing prior to deployment.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;远程服务网络往返延迟过高是需要通过压测暴露的风险。&lt;SEP&gt;压测is used to expose high network round-trip latency to remote services.&lt;SEP&gt;Stress testing exposes high network round-trip latency issues with remote services before deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;远程服务网络往返延迟过高为实践中常见问题，需通过压测在上线前暴露。&lt;SEP&gt;Stress testing exposes high network round-trip latency issues before deployment.</data>
  <data key="d9">exposed by,exposes,reveals,暴露,暴露问题,检测,测试,测试发现</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-c8ffe9a587b126f152ed3d89a146b445-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-73278a4a86960eeb576a8fd4c9ec6997-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-698d51a19d8a121ce581499d7b701668-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-65b9eea6e1cc6bb9f0cd2a47751a186f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f899139df5e1059396431415e770c6dd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e2ef524fbf3d9fe611d5a8e90fefdc9c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-98dce83da57b0395e163467c9dae521b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8613985ec49eb8f757ae6439e879bb2a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-68d30a9594728bc39aa24be94b319d21-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3f390d88e4c41f2747bfa2f1b5f87db-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-72b32a1f754ba1c09b3695e0cb6cde7f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b53b3a3d6ab90ce0268229151c9bde11-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6c8349cc7260ae62e3b1396831a8398f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a5771bce93e200c36f7cd9dfd0e5deaa-chunk-000</data>
