<edge source="主流程" target="数据预处理">
  <data key="d7">18.0</data>
  <data key="d8">(主流程, 数据预处理) is a unidirectional, sequential relation in which data preprocessing serves as a mandatory preliminary stage before data enters the main processing flow. Across various systems—including consistent hashing mechanisms, knowledge graph architectures, federal learning frameworks, semantic caching systems, and embedding model pipelines—raw data must first undergo preprocessing to be formatted, cleaned, or otherwise prepared. Only after this preparatory phase does the data proceed into the main workflow or main processing flow.

This relationship is consistently emphasized as a necessary prerequisite: preprocessing always precedes the main flow, and the main flow receives only preprocessed data. The preprocessing phase acts as a gateway, ensuring that raw data never directly enters the main processing stages. In all described contexts, the timing is uniformly defined—preprocessing occurs first, and the main flow (or main workflow, or main processing flow) is the subsequent stage in the data pipeline.

While the specific techniques of preprocessing are not detailed in the descriptions, its role as a prerequisite and its consistent placement before the main flow are uniformly highlighted across all contexts, including as a front-end step for system processing batches and for model processing stages. The relation is strictly directional: data flows from preprocessing into the main flow, and the main flow does not send data back to preprocessing.&lt;SEP&gt;Data passes through preprocessing before entering the main process flow.&lt;SEP&gt;数据经过预处理后进入主流程，主流程按批次处理数据并维护状态一致性。&lt;SEP&gt;Preprocessed data enters the main processing flow of the message queue.&gt;</data>
  <data key="d9">enters,feeds data into,feeds into,precedes,前置,流程,输入,输入流程,进入,进入流程</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-c8ffe9a587b126f152ed3d89a146b445-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-da4fb5c6e93e74d3df8527599fa62642-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7f6ffaa6bb0b408017b62254211691b5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-698d51a19d8a121ce581499d7b701668-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ed3d2c21991e3bef5e069713af9fa6ca-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8613985ec49eb8f757ae6439e879bb2a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2a38a4a9316c49e5a833517c45d31070-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d1fe173d08e959397adf34b1d77e88d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35f4a8d465e6e1edc05f3d8ab658c551-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-32bb90e8976aab5298d5da10fe66f21d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3f390d88e4c41f2747bfa2f1b5f87db-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3295c76acbf4caaed33c36b1b5fc2cb1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d9d4f495e875a2e075a1a4a6e1b9770f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6c8349cc7260ae62e3b1396831a8398f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a1d0c6e83f027327d8461063f4ac58a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3416a75f4cea9109507cacd8e2f2aefc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d645920e395fedad7bbbed0eca3fe2e0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d67d8ab4f4c10bf22aa353e27879133c-chunk-000</data>
