<edge source="状态一致性" target="批次处理">
  <data key="d7">16.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Batch processing maintains state consistency by ensuring that system state and data state remain synchronized and reliable throughout batch processing operations. This approach is applied across the entire processing pipeline, covering various stages of data handling, and is designed to uphold consistency during system operations. The relation emphasizes that the system achieves state consistency specifically through the use of batch processing methods, meaning that operations are grouped into batches to facilitate reliable synchronization of state and data. This method ensures that state consistency is preserved throughout all batch-related activities, from initial processing to final output, thereby supporting dependable system behavior.

The core principle of this relation is that batch processing inherently supports state consistency, as it allows for controlled, organized handling of data in a way that maintains alignment between the system's operational state and the data being processed. This consistency is maintained across different operations and throughout the duration of the processing task, ensuring that no discrepancies arise between what the system tracks and what the data reflects. Batch processing maintains state consistency within the semantic caching system, where this synchronization is critical for reliable operation. The system relies on batch processing to maintain state consistency, and this requirement is applied both during the processing of each individual batch and as a general operational rule throughout the system.</data>
  <data key="d9">depends on,ensures,maintains,processing requirement,requires,state maintenance,保持,关联,确保,维护,维护关系,要求,需要</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-3def184ad8f4755ff269862ea77393dd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-202cb962ac59075b964b07152d234b70-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eb160de1de89d9058fcb0b968dbbbd68-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6974ce5ac660610b44d9b9fed0ff9548-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f899139df5e1059396431415e770c6dd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ac627ab1ccbdb62ec96e702f07f6425b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2a38a4a9316c49e5a833517c45d31070-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d2ddea18f00665ce8623e36bd4e3c7c5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-32bb90e8976aab5298d5da10fe66f21d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a3f390d88e4c41f2747bfa2f1b5f87db-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-66f041e16a60928b05a7e228a89c3799-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c0c7c76d30bd3dcaefc96f40275bdc0a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a1158154dfa42caddbd0694a4e9bdc8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f457c545a9ded88f18ecee47145a72c0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-17e62166fc8586dfa4d1bc0e1742c08b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d67d8ab4f4c10bf22aa353e27879133c-chunk-000</data>
